 "turns": [
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Hi, how are you holding up?",
   "est_sec": 1.96,
   "gap_before": 0.39,
   "role": "greeting",
   "phrasing": "greet_16"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "I'm alright, a bit tired.",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 0.87,
   "event": "greeting_answer",
   "phrasing": "greet_ans_05"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "I teach year four maths. Could board games actually help them learn?",
   "est_sec": 3.82,
   "gap_before": 0.44,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "board_games.dlg24"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Absolutely. Lots of games practise adding, counting and planning without feeling like a lesson.",
   "est_sec": 4.44,
   "gap_before": 1.06,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "board_games.dlg24"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Any you'd suggest for nine year olds?",
   "est_sec": 2.27,
   "gap_before": 0.48,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "board_games.dlg24"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Dice games where they add or multiply the rolls are easy wins. Shopping games with play money help with change and totals.",
   "est_sec": 6.92,
   "gap_before": 0.35,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "board_games.dlg24"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "I worry it'll just",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
   "gap_before": 1.03,
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "pause",
   "block": "board_games.dlg24"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "turn into chaos.",
   "est_sec": 1.03,
   "gap_before": 1.68,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "board_games.dlg24"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Small groups of four with clear jobs helps. One player keeps score, one manages the money, and they swap each round.",
   "est_sec": 6.61,
   "gap_before": 0.86,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "board_games.dlg24"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Could they make their own?",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 1.14,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "board_games.dlg24"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "That's a brilliant project. Designing a game makes them write rules, test them and fix them, which is a lot of thinking.",
   "est_sec": 6.92,
   "gap_before": 1.07,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "board_games.dlg24"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "I might steal that for next term.",
   "est_sec": 2.27,
   "gap_before": 1.35,
   "block": "board_games.dlg24"
  }
 ]
}
